## Format Requirements

- [ ] **A0, portrait orientation**
- [ ] All placeholder/synthetic numbers replaced with real results from [`Outputs Received/results.json`](../Outputs%20Received/results.json)
- [ ] Author names correct and complete
- [ ] QR code present and scanning to the intended target
- [ ] Physical A0 print in hand at least one day before the poster session

